  "description": "<div class=\"description-tabs tabs\">\n<div class=\"tabs__nav\">\n<div class=\"tabs__nav-item tabs__nav-item--active\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tabs__nav-item\">Ingredients</div>\n<div class=\"tabs__nav-item\">Nutrition Facts</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tabs__items-list\">\n<div class=\"tabs__item tabs__item--active\">\n<p>Try the sweet, fruity, juicy taste of organic strawberry. Berri Lyte is loaded with powerful nutrients and antioxidants. Made with flavorful ingredients found in nature. Formula proven for effective hydration plus fluid and electrolyte restoration.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tabs__item\">\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Filtered Water, Organic Coconut Water, Organic Agave Nectar, Organic Lemon Juice, Organic Vegetable Glycerin, Organic Strawberry Flavor, Sea Salt, Natural Flavors from Plants, Purple Carrot, Organic Monk Fruit Flavor, Organic Amla, Organic Sweet Potato Juice, Organic Guava, Zinc Gluconate, Organic Maqui Berries. </span><strong>Contains: Coconut.</strong></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tabs__item\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2227/4617/files/BerriLyte-Strawberry_NutritionFacts_480x480.png?v=1706826483\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
